                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This was our last meal of our Taipei trip, and it did not let us down! We got quite an assortment of dishes and all of them were wonderful. I could not pick just one favorite item. It is probably good to go here with a group so you can try a bunch. The service was excellent, they kept our table full and made sure we had everything we needed. This was the perfect end to our short trip to Taiwan, Thanks! (also, thanks to Johnnie for taking us to this spot for our farewell meal!)",
